# What the image may contain, and nothing else (Dockerfile). Everything is excluded first, then
# only the build's inputs are let back in: no secrets and none of the owner's data can reach the
# image, even ones not listed here.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!alembic.ini
!docker-entrypoint.sh
!src/
!migrations/

# Never, even inside the folders let in above (last match wins):
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/teacher.db*
**/knowledge_sources
**/artifacts
**/derived
**/backups
**/supabase
**/.venv
**/tests
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
